   - Expected: outcome.mutation.after_application_payload_root equals `[600]`
   - Expected: snapshot.revision equals `4)  # oracle: 4 — pinned expected value for this behavior`
   - Expected: snapshot.snapshot_token equals `800)  # oracle: 800 — pinned expected value for this behavior`
